  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "collecting-fragments",
      "title": "Collecting fragments",
      "anchor": "Collecting_fragments",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Collect a total of 32 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Flame_fragment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">flame fragments</a> from any of the NPCs (maximum 6 per type of NPC). You only need to pickpocket 6 different NPCs and only need 2 fragments from the final type of NPC you choose to steal from. The flame fragments are unreclaimable upon death, you can bank them before going to the next location."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "label": "NPC's · Locations",
          "head": [
            "NPC&#39;s",
            "Locations"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "Citizens (<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Man\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">men</a> and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Woman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">women</a>)",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lumbridge_Market\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lumbridge Market</a>, and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Al_Kharid\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Al Kharid</a>, at the marketplace."
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/H.A.M._member\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">H.A.M. members</a>",
              "Lockpick the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Trapdoor_(H.A.M._Hideout)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">trapdoor</a> in the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lumbridge_forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lumbridge forest</a> northwest of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lumbridge_Castle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lumbridge Castle</a>."
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Farmer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Farmers</a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lumbridge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lumbridge</a>, in the chicken pen area east of the river."
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Master_Farmer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Master Farmers</a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Draynor_Village\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Draynor Village</a>, roaming in the marketplace; Lumbridge near the vegetable stall."
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Al_Kharid_warrior\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Warriors</a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Al_Kharid\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Al Kharid</a>, in the palace courtyard. <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Warrior_woman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Warrior women</a> in <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ardougne\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ardougne</a> count."
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Guards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Guards</a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Varrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Varrock</a>, near south and west entrances or palace courtyard."
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Rogue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rogues</a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Rogues%27_Castle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rogues&#39; Castle</a>, use teleport <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Obelisk_(Wilderness)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">obelisks</a> in the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Wilderness\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Wilderness</a>."
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Cave_goblin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cave goblins</a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Dorgesh-Kaan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dorgesh-Kaan</a>, roaming in the centre of the marketplace."
